OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 11 MAY
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Florence
OL,5,     FPrice
OL,6,     GKate Molleson explores Florence
OL,7,     GPrice's early life and musical
OL,8,     Gformation, in conversation with
OL,9,     Gpianist and scholar Samantha Ege.
OL,10,G1700FIn Tune
OL,11,     GPetroc Trelawny speaks to mezzo
OL,12,     Gsoprano Helen Charlston and
OL,13,     Gpianist Sholto Kynoch about their
OL,14,     Gnew album, and pianist Nikolai
OL,15,     GLugansky performs live ahead of a
OL,16,     GWigmore Hall recital.
OL,17,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,18,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,19,     Gsoundscape of classical music
OL,20,     Gwith music from Allegri, Beach
OL,21,     Gand Mozart.
